{
 "_goal": "Local web page walks 'talk -> reply appears -> companion mood follows' with fake data; a happy line makes it smile, a sad line makes it sad with you.",
 "_selectors": "fe-engineer must expose these data-testid hooks: fake-input (text fallback for the utterance), reply (latest companion reply), companion (the character, with data-mood=<pleasant-high|pleasant-low|unpleasant-high|unpleasant-low|neutral>).",
